        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Subject us to negative economic, competitive and regulatory developments, any or all of which may have a substantial adverse impact on the particular industry in which we operate after our initial business combination, and",
        "start_character": 33764,
        "end_character": 33986
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134550",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134550-fae7377b844cfaba",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-134550",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The decision as to whether we will seek shareholder approval of a proposed business combination or will allow shareholders to sell their shares to us in a tender offer will be made by us, solely in our discretion, and will be based on business and legal reasons, which include a variety of factors, including, but not limited to:",
        "start_character": 37960,
        "end_character": 38289
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134550",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134550-fae7377b844cfaba",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-134550",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Unlike other blank check companies which require shareholder votes and conduct proxy solicitations in conjunction with their initial business combinations and related conversions of public shares for cash upon consummation of such initial business combination even when a vote is not required by law, we will have the flexibility to avoid such shareholder vote and allow our shareholders to sell their shares pursuant to Rule 13e-4 and Regulation 14E of the Exchange Act which regulate issuer tender offers.",
        "start_character": 38923,
        "end_character": 39430
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134550",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134550-fae7377b844cfaba",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-134550",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are required to use our reasonable best efforts to have all third parties (including any vendors or other entities we engage after the Offering) and any prospective target businesses enter into agreements with us waiving any right, title, interest or claim of any kind they may have in or to any monies held in the trust account.",
        "start_character": 52514,
        "end_character": 52846
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134550",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134550-fae7377b844cfaba",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-134550",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we will focus on the A&D services industry and the TMT industry, including TMT companies focused on cybersecurity and secured communications and quantum-based command and control systems, AI and ML, we will not seek a target that is pre-revenue or in early stages of development with unproven technologies.",
        "start_character": 22138,
        "end_character": 22450
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134550",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134550-fae7377b844cfaba",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-134550",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Alternatively, we may provide our public shareholders with the opportunity to sell their public shares to us through a tender offer (and thereby avoid the need for a shareholder vote) for an amount equal to their pro rata share of the aggregate amount then on deposit in the trust account, less any taxes then due but not yet paid.",
        "start_character": 40509,
        "end_character": 40840
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134550",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134550-fae7377b844cfaba",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-134550",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Given our management’s experience, we are confident that our officers and directors will be able to drive value after the combination.",
        "start_character": 8450,
        "end_character": 8584
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134550",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134550-fae7377b844cfaba",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-134550",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "Additionally, any loans made by our officers, directors, Sponsor or their affiliates for working capital needs will be forgiven and not repaid if we are unable to complete an initial business combination.",
        "start_character": 56087,
        "end_character": 56291
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134550",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134550-fae7377b844cfaba",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-134550",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "Any proxy solicitation materials we furnish to shareholders in connection with a vote for any proposed business combination will indicate whether we are requiring shareholders to satisfy such certification and delivery requirements.",
        "start_character": 44025,
        "end_character": 44257
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-134550",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-134550-fae7377b844cfaba",
